<p>			    TIME (in IST)</p>
<p>	 1030    1100    1200    1300    1400    1500    1600</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Bid/Ask Bid/Ask Bid/Ask Bid/Ask Bid/Ask Bid/Ask Bid/Ask</p>
<p>------- ------- ------- ------- ------- ------- -------</p>
<p>Jan -   3/5     4/5     3/5     3/4     3/4     3/5     3/5</p>
<p>Feb -  20/22   20/22   20/23   20/22   20/22   19/22   20/22</p>
<p>Mar -  44/47   44/47   46/49   45/47   44/46   45/47   45/48</p>
